//
// Setup: Isolated emit-c. Imports std/quantum_tensor_nets/cft_scaling_dimensions_mera.oo.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Call scaling_operator_from_eigenvalue twice with the same args.
//   2. Exit 1 if the two results differ.
